[{"type":"function","name":"speak_explanation","description":"Speak a short explanation in ordered segments. Bind to state.display.identity. Each segment contains only one idea and highlights only its named squares. Use observation only for supplied verified facts; advice for recommendations; possibility for uncertain reasoning, explicitly qualified in text. The app starts each segment highlight at audio playback. Do not speak a preamble or repeat the script afterward.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string"},"displayIdentity":{"type":"string"},"segments":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":400},"squares":{"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"}},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["observation","advice","possibility"]}},"required":["text","squares","kind"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["positionId","displayIdentity","segments"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"get_board","description":"Read the live board, position identity, legal moves and verified turn facts. The response already includes a fresh live board; refresh only if its position changed or information is missing. Coordinates are from White’s side.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"analyze_position","description":"Ask Stockfish to analyze the observed position. Engine scores are not win probabilities. Do not invent tactical explanations.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100}},"required":["positionId"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"test_move","description":"Analyze a hypothetical White move with Stockfish and compare it with the engine recommendation. Does not play the move or change the board. Use demonstrate_moves to show a validated line from the result.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"from":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},"to":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},"promotion":{"type":"string","enum":["q","r","b","n"]}},"required":["positionId","from","to"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"inspect_piece","description":"Inspect attacks and legal destinations for a piece on the observed board.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"square":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"}},"required":["positionId","square"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"highlight_squares","description":"Highlight the pieces or draw arrows while explaining the current board. This never moves a piece.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"squares":{"maxItems":8,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"}},"arrows":{"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"array","items":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"}],"additionalItems":false,"minItems":2,"maxItems":2}}},"required":["positionId","squares","arrows"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"demonstrate_moves","description":"Show a reversible imagined line on the board. All moves are validated. Prefer paused demonstrations and advance while explaining. Never claim imagined moves were played.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"introduction":{"default":"","type":"string","maxLength":500},"lines":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":60},"moves":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":12,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"uci":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8][a-h][1-8][qrbn]?$"},"explanation":{"default":"","type":"string","maxLength":500},"arrows":{"default":[],"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"array","items":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"}],"additionalItems":false,"minItems":2,"maxItems":2}},"highlights":{"default":[],"maxItems":8,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"sq":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["go","no","focus","check"]}},"required":["sq","kind"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["uci","explanation","arrows","highlights"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["label","moves"],"additionalProperties":false}},"autoplay":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100}},"required":["title","introduction","lines","autoplay","positionId"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"control_demonstration","description":"Seek, play, pause or close an existing demonstration. Respect the learner’s pause or dismissal.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"demonstrationId":{"type":"string"},"action":{"type":"string","enum":["play","pause","seek","close"]},"ply":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":12},"line":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":2}},"required":["positionId","demonstrationId","action"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"type":"function","name":"play_requested_move","description":"Play ONE legal White move only when the learner explicitly asked you to do so in their current spoken turn AND assisted moves are enabled. Never call during proactive commentary. Read the board first; explain the chosen move.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"positionId":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"from":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},"to":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-h][1-8]$"},"promotion":{"type":"string","enum":["q","r","b","n"]}},"required":["positionId","from","to"],"additionalProperties":false}}]